# Patterns to ignore when building packages.
# VCS
.git/
.gitignore
# Test / session artifacts
.playwright-mcp/
*.png
*.log
dist/
# Rendered output parked inside the chart. Helm loads every file under
# templates/ and passes a plain YAML through untouched, so last render's output
# becomes this render's template and the manifest doubles each time. It would
# also be applied for real by helm install. Prefer redirecting to dist/ or /tmp;
# these are the backstop. Subcharts do not inherit this file — charts/cluster
# carries its own copy.
rendered*.yaml
out*.yaml
manifest*.yaml
*.rendered.yaml
*.out.yaml
# OS / IDE
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
# CI / docs not needed inside the package
Makefile
